EZMB_URDA_SEEDBED.description:
Gain {Block:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold]. Set up a [blue]{Capacity}[/blue]-space [gold]Seedbed[/gold].{ImmediateLine}
Later, before eligible cards enter your hand, Seedbed spends remaining spaces to [gold]plant[/gold] them. Planting means: remove that card from the current combat, then add [blue]1[/blue] [gold]Withered Husk[/gold] to your hand. It does not count as play, discard, or the [gold]Exhaust[/gold] keyword, and it does not trigger those synergies.
Eligible: [gold]Temporary[/gold] Status cards, [gold]Temporary[/gold] Curse cards, [gold]Blight Sprouts[/gold], and [gold]Rootblight[/gold]. Permanent Curses are not permanently deleted by Seedbed. Temporary Status/Curses disappear after combat. [gold]Blight Sprouts[/gold] count as handled for this combat and add no [gold]Rootblight I[/gold]. [gold]Rootblight[/gold] pauses its combat-end check: it does not improve, worsen, split, or cleanse itself, and it keeps the same stage after combat.
